msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"Dammit all... Shoulda never set foot in Kamurocho to\r\n"
"begin with... I knew I'd get dragged back in..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Relax. I'm not here to drag you into anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Huh? Wait a minute... Don't tell me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"You must be Kiryu-san! Wow! I'm standing face to face with a\r\n"
"legend!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"I used to be in the business, too, you know. And I heard all\r\n"
"kinds of crazy stories about you, man. You were like a god."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"But then you retired right after you were made fourth\r\n"
"chairman of the Tojo Clan. That's actually what inspired me\r\n"
"to leave the business myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Well, that's all fine and good... but I need to know what\r\n"
"you've been up to. Your wife's been worrying about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"She has? Hmm... Well, I guess there is one thing I haven't\r\n"
"managed to tell her yet... Think you can keep a secret?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"You see, I was asked to be a chef at the restaurant I work\r\n"
"part-time, so I started going to cooking school."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"The boss says I can get on full-time if I get me a cook's\r\n"
"license. To me, that's a golden opportunity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"We've been wanting to have us some kids soon... so I figured\r\n"
"having a proper salary was the best way to prepare."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "So you've been sneaking off to cooking school? Is that it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Well, it ain't my intention to be sneaky. I mean, sure, the\r\n"
"school my boss recommended is in a run-down building with no\r\n"
"sign out front, but the teacher there is world-class."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Then what's with the late night knife sharpening?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Oh, you mean this thing? Hah, I've been using this to gut\r\n"
"tuna... Guess it does kinda look like something you could\r\n"
"use to shank another guy... Get the blood flowing, haha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Now I see how this is all coming together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"Huh? What's coming together? And why's Ryoko all suspicious\r\n"
"of me all of a sudden? I wonder about that lady sometimes..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"Well, she said you've been a lot more well-off in the money\r\n"
"department than you should be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Oh, that. Well, I just so happened to win a nice wad of cash\r\n"
"at the mahjong tables, so I stashed some away for special\r\n"
"occasions. Man, that wife of mine's pretty sharp! Heheh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "There you are! What are you doing here!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't worry if I were you. Your husband's given me an\r\n"
"explanation for everything, and it all checks out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Huh...? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"You just gotta trust me, babe! I promised you I wasn't gonna\r\n"
"make you cry! That was... one of my wedding vows..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Then you remembered... You remembered your promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"Of course I remembered, babe! You think I'd forget a thing\r\n"
"like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Sorry for putting you through all this drama, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "I hope you'll take this for your troubles!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "You got <Color:8>70,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"Thank you for all your help. I feel like I can trust my\r\n"
"husband so much more now... Well, I'd better get going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"(What could he be up to in there? I'm sure his wife would\r\n"
"like to know.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"It's Kiryu... Uh-huh... Right near Smile Burger... That's\r\n"
"right... You'll recognize it when you get here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "(Well... Now what?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"Hey, asshole! I know you've been following me! So just tell\r\n"
"me what you want already!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "Hey, hold on. You've got it all wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's what they all say! Well, too bad for you,\r\n"
"'cause there's no way in hell you're dragging me back to\r\n"
"that life! I'll fight you tooth and nail if I have to!"
msgstr ""

